			text = [=[The last drops of the moonwells' water came to Tyrande in a ceremonial vessel, after the Arch Druid had cast it aside. She thanked the bearer, for every drop was blessed by Elune. She also spoke, briefly and sharply, of {link:fandral-staghelm}Fandral{/link}: he had done much in {link:malfurion-stormrage}Malfurion{/link}'s absence, but he was not Malfurion.]=],
